{
  "name": "02 - Inbound B2B Domain DNS, RFC 9116 Security.txt & Hiring Enricher (RevClamp)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Inbound B2B Domain DNS, RFC 9116 & Hiring Enricher\n\n**1. Instant Zero-Key Test (Works Out-of-the-Box with Zero Credentials):**\nClick **Test workflow** right now. The pinned inbound lead (`linear.app`) runs live against `POST https://revclamp.com/api/v1/b2b/domain-intelligence` (`demo: true`) and `RevClamp Hiring Watchlist` (`demoMode: true`) with zero API keys, and outputs a formatted AE Enrichment Preview.\n\n**2. Production Webhook Setup:**\n- Point your HubSpot / PostHog / Typeform / signup webhook to `Inbound Signup Webhook` (`POST /webhook/revclamp-inbound-domain-enricher`).\n- Provision a free workspace key (`rg_live_YOUR_WORKSPACE_KEY`) at `https://revclamp.com/tools/ats-hiring-watchlist`.\n- On `Normalize Inbound Lead`, paste your Slack Incoming Webhook URL (`https://hooks.slack.com/services/<TEAM_ID>/<BOT_ID>/<WEBHOOK_KEY>`) into `slackWebhookUrl` and set `demo` to `false`.\n- On `Domain DNS & RFC 9116 Intelligence`, add header `Authorization: Bearer rg_live_YOUR_WORKSPACE_KEY`.\n- On `RevClamp Hiring Watchlist (Board Diff)`, set `demoMode: false` and connect your `revClampApi` credential.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1020002-0002-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Quickstart & Webhook Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1020002-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Test Sample Inbound Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "revclamp-inbound-domain-enricher",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1020002-0002-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Inbound Signup Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "webhookId": "revclamp-inbound-domain-enricher-v1",
      "position": [
        200,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "field-company-domain",
              "name": "company_domain",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.company_domain || $json.company_domain || ($json.body?.email || $json.email || 'ops@linear.app').split('@')[1] || 'linear.app').trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-lead-source",
              "name": "lead_source",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.lead_source || $json.lead_source || 'inbound_demo_request' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-slack-webhook",
              "name": "slackWebhookUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.slackWebhookUrl || $json.slackWebhookUrl || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "field-demo-flag",
              "name": "demo",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.demo !== undefined ? Boolean($json.body.demo) : ($json.demo !== undefined ? Boolean($json.demo) : true) }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1020002-0002-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Normalize Inbound Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://revclamp.com/api/v1/b2b/domain-intelligence",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domain: $json.company_domain, demo: $json.demo }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "b1020002-0002-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Domain DNS & RFC 9116 Intelligence",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "watchlist",
        "operation": "previewDiff",
        "demoMode": true,
        "preset": "devtools_outbound_diff"
      },
      "id": "b1020002-0002-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "RevClamp Hiring Watchlist (Board Diff)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-revclamp.revClampHiringWatchlist",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        540
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const lead = $('Normalize Inbound Lead').first().json || {};\nconst domIntel = $('Domain DNS & RFC 9116 Intelligence').first().json || {};\nconst hiring = $input.first().json || {};\n\nconst domain = domIntel.domain || lead.company_domain || 'linear.app';\nconst mxStatus = domIntel.mx_status || 'unknown';\nconst spfStatus = domIntel.spf_status || 'unknown';\nconst dmarcPolicy = domIntel.dmarc_policy || 'none';\nconst paymentProvider = domIntel.payment_provider || 'unknown';\nconst atsProvider = domIntel.ats_provider || hiring.atsProvider || 'UNKNOWN';\nconst securityTxtStatus = domIntel.security_txt_status || 'missing';\nconst securityContact = domIntel.security_contact || 'none';\n\nconst openedRoles = Number(hiring.counts?.opened ?? 0);\nconst compChangedRoles = Number(hiring.counts?.compChanged ?? 0);\nconst totalOpenRoles = Number(hiring.total_open_roles ?? openedRoles);\n\nconst isEnterpriseHighIntent = mxStatus === 'present' && (openedRoles > 0 || totalOpenRoles > 0 || domIntel.ats_status === 'observed');\n\nconst rawWebhook = String(lead.slackWebhookUrl || '').trim();\nconst hasLiveSlackWebhook = rawWebhook.startsWith('https://hooks.slack.com/services/') && !rawWebhook.includes('<');\n\nconst summaryText = [\n  `*High-Intent Inbound B2B Account: ${domain}* (Source: ${lead.lead_source || 'webhook'})`,\n  `- DNS Deliverability: MX=${mxStatus}, SPF=${spfStatus}, DMARC=${dmarcPolicy}`,\n  `- RFC 9116 security.txt: ${securityTxtStatus} (${securityContact})`,\n  `- Billing & ATS Stack: Payment=${paymentProvider} | ATS=${atsProvider} (${domIntel.ats_board_slug || hiring.boardKey || 'verified'})`,\n  `- Hiring Velocity Signal: +${openedRoles} newly opened roles, ${compChangedRoles} comp band raises`\n].join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    domain,\n    lead_source: lead.lead_source || 'webhook',\n    mx_status: mxStatus,\n    spf_status: spfStatus,\n    dmarc_policy: dmarcPolicy,\n    payment_provider: paymentProvider,\n    ats_provider: atsProvider,\n    security_txt_status: securityTxtStatus,\n    security_contact: securityContact,\n    opened_roles: openedRoles,\n    comp_changed_roles: compChangedRoles,\n    is_enterprise_high_intent: isEnterpriseHighIntent,\n    slackWebhookUrl: rawWebhook,\n    hasLiveSlackWebhook,\n    summary_text: summaryText\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "b1020002-0002-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Score Domain + Hiring Posture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        540
      ]
    },
